# The SLO evaluator's timer (SPEC-031 R4; ADR-031): every five minutes, as the observability pack's
# evaluator timer runs it, with a short random delay so it never fires in step with the other
# timers. The calendar is written in UTC; five minutes is the same span in every zone. With no
# Unit=, the timer starts the service of its own name.
[Unit]
Description=DeckStreak's SLO evaluation, every five minutes
X-DurableServices-Waive=calendar-not-persistent each run measures rolling windows that end at its own start, so the next run five minutes later measures everything a run missed while the host was down

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* *:00/5:00 UTC
RandomizedDelaySec=30s
AccuracySec=1us

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
